    <!-- FAQ -->
    <string name="faq_1_title">Why does the app need an internet connection?</string>
    <string name="faq_1_text">Unfortunately it is required for sending MMS attachments. Not being able to send MMS at all was too big a gap next to other apps, so this was the way chosen.
    As always, there are no ads, no tracking and no analytics; the connection is used for sending MMS and nothing else.</string>
    <string name="faq_2_title">The other side is not receiving my MMS, what can I do?</string>
    <string name="faq_2_text">MMS size is capped by the carrier; you can set a lower limit in the app settings.</string>
    <string name="faq_3_title">Does the app support scheduled messages?</string>
    <string name="faq_3_text">Yes. Press and hold the send button, then pick the date and time you want the message to go out.</string>
    <string name="faq_4_title">Why do my group replies arrive separately for each recipient?</string>
    <string name="faq_4_text">Turn on \"Send group messages as MMS\" in the settings. Group messages then go out as real MMS and everyone in the thread sees each other\'s replies.</string>
